<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.605 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.605 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia</p>
<p>said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p>     13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.605	 5.60-5.61   5.637</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 90)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.738	 5.73-5.79   5.805</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top two)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.593	 5.56-5.60   5.615</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 85)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
